= Bank Failures

Silicon Valley Bank and other regional lenders have collapsed, and depositors are panicking. Regulators have to decide whether to guarantee deposits.

- @bank_backstop: Back a broad deposit guarantee
- @bank_reform: Demand tougher bank regulation

@bank_backstop
on-arrival: budget -= 1; biz_relation += 3; economic_growth += 0.2; progressive_dissent += 3; populist_dissent += 3

Panic ebbs, to the fury of populists on both sides.

@bank_reform
on-arrival: biz_relation -= 4; progressive_dissent -= 3; populist_strength += 2; economic_growth -= 0.1

We introduce a tough regulatory package.
